":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/TouchOrigamiExampleView/View-Implementations":{"title":"View Implementations","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/TouchOrigamiExampleView\/View-Implementations","abstract":[],"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/touchorigamiexampleview\/view-implementations","type":"topic","role":"collectionGroup"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/TouchOrigamiExampleView/init()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/TouchOrigamiExampleView\/init()","title":"init()","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/touchorigamiexampleview\/init()","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/7SwiftUI4ViewP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/7SwiftUI4ViewP","title":"SwiftUICore.View"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentat